/* Landfall — the seat's other officer says a card's line their own way (Lachlan, 2026-11-18; DESIGN.md "Whose line it is").
   One entry for each quoted line on a card that belongs to a seat's officer: src is the quote exactly as it stands in the card's
   source, alt is the same moment said by the seat's second officer, with the same ${...} pieces. LF.revoice (js/speak.js) puts alt in
   place of src when that officer holds the chair. Written one officer at a time, each by a writer who saw only that officer's brief.
   If a card's line changes, change its src here to match or the swap stops (node tools/voices-check.js lists the ones that no longer match).
   Data only. */
LF.ALT_VOICE = [
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's not binding. Yet. Say no and it will be.\"", "alt": "Listen, it isn't binding yet. But if you tell them no, it will be, and I don't want that fight for our people if you and I can talk it through first."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Whichever you don't pick, we'll be burying people over.\"", "alt": "Whichever one we leave, we'll be burying our people over it, and I want you to hear that plainly before you choose."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"The vault is the only copy.\"", "alt": "Listen, that vault is the only copy we've got, the only copy, and I won't see all of it go in the ground on one planting."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Shield's got one clean re-entry left. One and a half at a push.\"", "alt": "Here's the deal. The shield's got one clean re-entry left, one and a half if we push her, and I don't like pushing her with our people aboard."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"${s.sleepers} people up there. There's no second flight for them.\"", "alt": "We've got ${s.sleepers} of our people up there, and there's no second flight for them, none at all."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It's the only book the kids get, so they'll believe every page. Before I write this one: do they learn about ${c.worst}, yes or no?\"", "alt": "Listen, it's the only book the kids are going to get, and they'll believe every page of it. So I'm asking you straight, do they learn about ${c.worst}, yes or no?"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Lower means it comes down. Thirty years. Maybe on us. That's a problem for thirty years from now.\"", "alt": "Here's the deal. Lower means it comes down in thirty years, maybe right on top of us, and that's our people's problem thirty years from now, not ours, and I don't love saying so."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"A post in this system, or a relay with someone listening at the far end. I want to know which.\"", "alt": "It's either a post somewhere in this system or a relay with somebody listening at the far end, and I need to know which before we do anything else."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"We don't know how long the year is. We don't know what comes round on the long orbits. One season with the telescope.\"", "alt": "Listen, we don't know how long the year is, and we don't know what comes round on the long orbits, and our people are going to live under it. All I'm asking for is one season with the telescope."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Wide or far. Batteries for one this season. Pick.\"", "alt": "We can fly wide or we can fly far, and the batteries only stretch to one of them this season. I'd like to hear which way you lean before I say which way I do."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I make it two degrees,\"", "alt": "All right, here's what I'm seeing, I make it two degrees,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"A month of sightings tells us the same thing a month later. Give the order and I'll fly it.\"", "alt": "A month of sightings is only going to tell us the same thing a month later, and I don't want to spend a month on that. Give me the order and I'll fly it."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I can boost her by hand. Or you can send me fuel. Decide.\"", "alt": "I can boost her by hand, or you can send me fuel, and either way it's your call and I'll back it. Which is it going to be?"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Theirs and mine. It's handled.\"", "alt": "Theirs and mine, both of us. We're all right up here, and I'll tell you straight if that changes."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Four hundred pages, and nobody who wrote them is alive. We want a vote. First one's on whether we get one.\"", "alt": "We've read the whole thing, four hundred pages, and nobody who wrote them is alive to say what they meant. Our people want a vote, and the first one ought to be on whether we get one."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Fine. Now we know where we stand,\"", "alt": "All right. I'd hoped for better than this, but now we know where we stand,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"One of them gets nothing. You pick which. I'm not having it be nobody's fault.\"", "alt": "One of them gets nothing, and I won't pretend otherwise to our people. You choose which, and I'll stand next to you when we tell them, because it ought to be somebody's call and not nobody's fault."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Suspend it. All of it. Until ${c.dn} is done. Then they can have their meetings.\"", "alt": "I hate asking this, I do, but I think we suspend the meetings, all of them, until ${c.dn} is done. Then folks get their say again, every bit of it, and I'll stand up and tell them so myself."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Stellar flare. Small one. Survey had this star down as quiet. Survey was wrong.\"", "alt": "That's a stellar flare, a small one, and the survey had this star down as quiet. Well, the survey was wrong, and I'd rather our people heard it from us now than found out later."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Same track as the last four. Every year, this time. Two days, maybe less.\"", "alt": "It's following the same track as the last four, every year around this time, and we've got two days, maybe less. I want our people under cover before it gets here."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Something has to change, and it has to be big enough that they feel it. There are three ideas. Pick one,\"", "alt": "Listen, something has to change, and it has to be big enough that folks feel it. There are three ideas on the table, and I'd like you to pick one,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Names slow the roster down. Leave it.\"", "alt": "Names slow the roster down, I know that, so I'd leave it for now. But I don't like it, and I want the crew leads to hear me say so."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"${s.sleepers ? `Up, wake ${LF.wakeWord(s)}, down again. ` : ''}${LF.inOrbit(s).length ? 'There\\'s a seat for an officer. ' : ''}${LF.aboard(s).length ? 'One cradle for whatever\\'s still in the hold. ' : ''}It's hard on her, every time.\"", "alt": "${s.sleepers ? `Up, wake ${LF.wakeWord(s)}, down again. ` : ''}${LF.inOrbit(s).length ? 'There\\'s a seat for an officer. ' : ''}${LF.aboard(s).length ? 'One cradle for whatever\\'s still in the hold. ' : ''}It's hard on her every time, and I don't like asking it of her."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"I didn't set it. Asked who showed them. Nobody, they said.\"", "alt": "I didn't set it, I promise you that. I asked who showed them, and they all said nobody, every one of them."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Two percent. I've checked the glass three times, and it isn't the glass. Dust is all I've got left.\"", "alt": "It's two percent, and I've checked the glass three times because I wanted it to be the glass, and it isn't. Dust is all I've got left, and I don't like telling you that."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"The name goes,\"", "alt": "The name has to go,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Tonight. Anyone who says it does a week in the pits. The kids too.\"", "alt": "Tonight, and I hate saying it. Anyone who says it does a week in the pits, the kids too, and I'll stand in front of the rows and tell them why myself."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"One rifle. Two nights. Back on the third,\"", "alt": "Here's the deal, one rifle, two nights, and I'll be back on the third,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"It lies up by day. I find where. Lift the bar.\"", "alt": "It lies up by day, and all I'm going to do is find where. I need you to lift the bar for me."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"We pack and haul, a season, and lose what we can't carry. Or we stay and stop asking. I want one by tonight.\"", "alt": "We pack and haul for a season and lose what we can't carry, or we stay and stop asking the question. Either way it's hard on our people, so I need one from you by tonight."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"She's flying my lander,\"", "alt": "All right, listen, she's flying our lander,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Not me. Her. Get me the mechanic and a set of cutters.\"", "alt": "That isn't me doing it, it's her, and I'm not blaming anybody down here. Get me the mechanic and a set of cutters."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"They voted for it. They didn't say how,\"", "alt": "They voted for it, and I won't say the folks were wrong to, but they didn't say how,"},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"That's ours. Implants, or a wall between the rows. Pick one.\"", "alt": "That part's ours, and it's a hard one. It's implants or a wall between the rows, and I want to hear which you'd pick."},
  {"seat": "command", "src": "\"Closer every night. More of them every night. We don't have long.\"", "alt": "They're closer every night, and there are more of them every night, and I won't tell our people we've got more time than we do. We don't have long."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We walk the inside of the fence with a lamp. We see as far as the lamp. Whatever's out there knows exactly how far that is.\"", "alt": "With respect, my people walk the inside of the fence with a lamp, and they can see only as far as the lamp reaches, so whatever came last night knew exactly where that ends."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"By the wording you signed, it's a refused shift. Lock-up and a half ladle till the shift's worked. Lovely thing to have my name on.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but by the wording you signed it counts as a refused shift, which means lock-up and a half ladle until the shift is worked. I'd like it noted that I'll carry it out if you order it, and that I don't like having my name on it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"They want it to be somebody's fault, so fine, I can make it ${c.name}'s. ${c.first} ${c.pin}, talks too much, and has no friends on the watch, which is lovely for us: one hearing, one afternoon, and the whole colony sleeps like a baby. Or you can go out there and tell them nobody did it, and I'll stand by the door and enjoy how that goes.\"", "alt": "With respect, they want somebody to blame, and I could give them ${c.name}, because ${c.first} ${c.pin} and has no friends on the watch to speak up. One hearing would settle the colony by tonight, and I'd like it noted that I take no pleasure in saying so. The other way is for you to tell them plainly that nobody did it, and I'll stand beside you while you do."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"They nicked our tools on the way out, and now they're sitting on a good roof and a full store, laughing at us, I'd bet,\"", "alt": "They took our tools when they left, and I'd like it noted that they're sitting on a good roof and a full store while we go short,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Four days and I'll have the lot back, and the people too if you want them, though I can't think why you would.\"", "alt": "I can have the lot back in four days, and the people too if you want them, though I'd ask that you let me go myself first and not send any of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"They made their bed, and now they'd like to lie in ours,\"", "alt": "They've sent a runner asking to come home, and I can't say I blame them,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Fine, but it's on our terms, and I'll be watching every one of them, because anyone who walks out once will walk out twice.\"", "alt": "I'd ask that it be on terms everyone has heard, with my people at the gate counting every one of them in, because anyone who has gone once might go again and I'd rather we knew."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Right now it's all in one building, which is the only good news you'll get tonight, and it won't stay that way, because it never does.\"", "alt": "First, it's all in one building tonight, and I'd like that noted, because I don't expect it to stay that way and I'd rather tell you now than apologise for it later."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"A border? We'd be holding it every bloody year, and they only need to get lucky once,\"", "alt": "I've tried to find a way to hold a border, and my people would be standing on it every year while they'd only have to get through once,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"All of them, the young too. One season, and we never do it twice, and then the ground's ours and nobody stands another night watch.\"", "alt": "If it must be done, then it's all of them, the young too, in one season and never again, and I'd like it on the record that I hate saying so. After that the ground is ours and none of mine have to stand another night watch over it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We go in at night, and the store comes back with us, and anyone fit to dig. They're people like us, aren't they, so they already know the work, and it saves us the training.\"", "alt": "I'd ask you to hear me out, because I've thought about this a long while. We go in at night, and the store comes back with us, and with anyone fit to dig, and they're people like us who already know the work, which is the only reason I can bring myself to say it, and I'd go in first myself."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Hurt things go to ground and mend,\"", "alt": "With respect, hurt things go to ground and mend,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and then they come back, so I'd like to be standing there when ${pl(f) ? 'they do' : 'it does'}.\"", "alt": "and then they come back, so I'd ask to follow now, going first myself, so that my people are standing there when ${pl(f) ? 'they do' : 'it does'}."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Character-building,\"", "alt": "It's the order, and I'll carry it out, and I'm sorry for it,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely. So the sea wants its fish back,\"", "alt": "Nobody's hurt yet, and I'd like that noted, but it looks as though the sea wants its fish back,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Do we argue with it, or do we fish somewhere it isn't?\"", "alt": "With respect, do we argue with it, or do we fish somewhere it isn't?"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Three weeks on our heading, closing, and not a word on any band,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that it's been three weeks on our heading, closing, and it hasn't said a word on any band,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Bloody friendly of them. Shall we wait and see what they'd like?\"", "alt": "I can't call that friendly, and I'd like to ask whether we wait and see what they want before we do anything."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely. Now the ship\\'s trying to kill us as well, and I\\'m the one stuck up in her. What is it you want me to do about it?\"", "alt": "With respect, I'd like to know what you want done, because I'm the one up here in her while she falls. I'll do whatever's asked, and I'd be grateful to hear it plainly."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So I sit with them, and I like knowing who's down there before something goes wrong,\"", "alt": "I sit with them because I'd like to know every one of them by name before something goes wrong down there,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Arrest me, if you like.\"", "alt": "If it was wrong of me, I'll put myself on the report, and you can do as you see fit."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So either it's up there on the ship's channel or it's down here doing the ship's voice for us, and I'd love to be told which of those I'm meant to feel better about,\"", "alt": "I'd ask which of those is meant to comfort me, because either it's up there on the ship's channel or it's down here doing the ship's voice for us, and I'm afraid for my people at the wire either way,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Three isn't all of them, but it's plenty to hang, and the hall's done the sum already,\"", "alt": "Three isn't all of them, but the hall has done the sum already, and I'm sorry to say it will want somebody hanged,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"so the only question left is whether it's done tidily or the other way.\"", "alt": "so I'd ask that it's done properly and not the other way, and I'd like it noted that I'd rather it was neither."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So they're paying rent, with our dead, and it's bloody working,\"", "alt": "I'm afraid they're paying rent with our dead, and I'm sorry to say it seems to be working,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"which is the part I don't like, because anything that takes payment expects to be paid again.\"", "alt": "and what troubles me is that anything that takes payment expects to be paid again."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can shoot at what talks or I can leave alone what bites, but I can't do both off the same wall, and before you ask, yes, I tried, and the wall wasn't impressed.\"", "alt": "With respect, my people can fire at what speaks or they can leave alone what bites, but they can't do both from the same wall, and I'd like it noted that I tried it and I'm sorry it didn't hold."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It used to keep hours and now it's always night, which is marvellous,\"", "alt": "It used to keep hours, and now it's always night, and my people are worn thin by it,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and I've got enough rifles for the fields or the rows, so tell me which half of the colony you'd like guarded.\"", "alt": "and I have enough rifles for the fields or the rows but not for both, so I'd ask you to tell me which half of the colony you want guarded."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I've got a watch on the children and a watch on the women, and now they're watching each other, which is wonderful,\"", "alt": "I have a watch on the children and a watch on the women, and now they're watching each other, and I'm sorry but I'm out of people to set over it,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and I'd love to know who's meant to watch that.\"", "alt": "and I'd ask you who is meant to watch that."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"That's an eviction notice,\"", "alt": "I'm afraid that reads like a notice to leave,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"They could've killed any of us and didn't bother, which is either manners or a warning, and I'd like to know which before they come back with the second notice.\"", "alt": "They could have killed any one of us and didn't, and I can't tell whether that's mercy or a warning, and I'd like to know which before they come back a second time."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We can fight ${c.g.them}. Or we go after whatever's bringing ${c.g.them} on. Not both, because I haven't the people for both, and I won't tell you I have.\"", "alt": "My people can fight ${c.g.them}, or we can go after whatever's bringing ${c.g.them} on, but I'd ask you not to make me do both, because I haven't the people for it and I won't say I have."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It won't last, and I don't trust it while it does, but if we're doing anything about ${c.g.them}, it's now.\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that I don't think it will last, and I don't trust it while it does, but if we're doing anything about ${c.g.them}, then it ought to be now."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Or we sit tight and let them find each other, since they're closer to each other than to us, and I'd be a very happy man if they saved me the bother.\"", "alt": "Or we sit tight and let them find each other, since they're nearer to each other than to us, and I'd be truly grateful if that spared my people a fight."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We held ${c.g.them}. Never finished ${c.g.them}. I did bloody say so at the time.\"", "alt": "My people held ${c.g.them}, and we never finished ${c.g.them}, and I'd like it noted that I said so at the time, though I'm not saying it to be proved right."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We've been living with ${c.g.them} like it's the weather, and weather doesn't pick its moment. Can we actually decide something, anything, before ${c.g.they} ${c.g.are === 'is' ? 'decides' : 'decide'} for us?\"", "alt": "With respect, we've lived beside ${c.g.them} the way we live with the weather, and weather doesn't choose its moment, so I'd ask that we decide something before ${c.g.they} ${c.g.are === 'is' ? 'decides' : 'decide'} for us."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I know every one of them, and I know which one goes for the gate first. Say the word.\"", "alt": "I know every one of them by name, and I know which one would reach the gate first, so I'd ask you to tell me what you want, because my people are waiting on it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody told them,\"", "alt": "I don't want to believe it, but somebody told them,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Or they're better at this than we are, and I know which one I'd rather lose sleep over, because the first one I can do something about.\"", "alt": "Or else they're simply better at this than we are, and I can't tell which it is, and I'd like it noted that I'd rather it were the second, because I won't think that of anyone here without proof."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely, that's half my job done,\"", "alt": "I'll be honest, it does make the roster quicker for the watch,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Could be nothing, could be ${c.first}'s always been like that and nobody ever looked,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that it could be nothing, and it could be ${c.first}'s always been like that and nobody ever looked,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Nobody remembers a thing about anyone until they've got a reason to, and now we've got one.\"", "alt": "I'm sorry to say nobody notices a thing about anyone until they have a reason to, and now we have one, so I'd ask that we go gently."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Blood doesn't lie and people do, so we ask the blood,\"", "alt": "I'd rather not accuse anyone on a feeling, so we ask the blood,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and we ask it where they can all watch, because a result nobody saw is a result somebody will say was fixed.\"", "alt": "and we ask it where everyone can watch, because I wouldn't want anybody to say afterwards that a result was fixed."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Any other year I wouldn't ask. This isn't any other year, ${TH.bec(s, c.k)}, and frightened people want telling what to do, so let me bloody tell them.\"", "alt": "Permission to speak plainly, any other year I wouldn't ask you for this. It isn't any other year, ${TH.bec(s, c.k)}, and frightened people want to be told what to do, so I'm asking you to let me tell them, and I'll be the one to answer for it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Fine. Hope you're right. And if you're not, guess who finds out first?\"", "alt": "Understood. I hope you're right, and I'd like it noted that if you're not, it will be the watch who finds out first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can keep order in the hall for a hearing, or outside it without one. Both, for long? I wouldn't put money on it.\"", "alt": "With respect, my people can keep order in the hall for a hearing, or outside it without one, but I don't think we can hold both for long, and I'd be guessing if I said otherwise."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I know what they're saying in the hall. You write that order and the watch won't carry it out, not while I've got the keys, and I'd sooner you heard that from me than found out when nobody moves.\"", "alt": "I know what they're saying in the hall, and I'd rather you heard it from me than found out when nobody moves. If you write that order the watch won't carry it out, not while I hold the keys, and I won't ask them to."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"${Cap(c.left)} till the number runs out, and I can't tell you what happens then. There's one thing that'd make it not matter. I'm not having the watch do it on my say-so. If it's happening, I want it in writing, in your hand, so that when somebody asks who gave the order it isn't my name they find.\"", "alt": "${Cap(c.left)} until the number runs out, and I can't tell you what happens after, and I'm sorry that I can't. There's one thing that would make it not matter, and I won't have my people do it on my word alone, so if it's happening I'd ask for it in writing, in your hand, so that when somebody asks who gave the order it isn't the name of anyone in the watch they find."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Tell the whole colony they've got ${months(T(s).len)} of dark coming? Some of them will sit down and never bloody get up.\"", "alt": "With respect, if we tell the whole colony they've got ${months(T(s).len)} of dark coming, I'm afraid some of them will sit down and never get up again."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Oh, they're happy, first time in months,\"", "alt": "I'm glad they're happy, for the first time in months,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"And I've counted, and every one they carry in brings two more looking for it, and the country's counting too, I promise you, and it likes the number.\"", "alt": "I'd like to be glad for them, but I've counted, and every one they carry in brings two more looking for it, and I'm afraid the country is counting too."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"That's the lot, then, everything with a mouth, and they've stopped quarrelling with each other to do it, which is the nicest thing they've ever done for us. I don't suppose you've got an order?\"", "alt": "With respect, that's everything with a mouth coming at the wire, and they've stopped quarrelling with each other to do it. I'd ask whether you've an order for us, because my people are at the gate and waiting."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Walked through a mob of them like they were washing on a line and never looked round once,\"", "alt": "I watched them walk through the whole mob of them without once looking round,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"so that's either the luckiest fool we've got or somebody who knows something, and I'd like to hear which before I bury anyone else.\"", "alt": "so either they've been lucky or they know something we don't, and I'd like to find out which before another of my people is buried."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Well, we showed it the worst we can do,\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but we did show it the worst we can do,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and it had a good look, and here it is anyway, so I hope whoever wanted that feels informed.\"", "alt": "and it saw it, and it came back anyway, and I can't tell you what would have turned it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We asked it nicely, and it's lovely to see how that goes,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that we asked it gently, and I have to report what that cost,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Can I have my rifles back now, or is the plan to sing to it?\"", "alt": "With respect, may I have the rifles back now, or is there something else you'd ask of the watch first?"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody\\'s hungry,\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but somebody's hungry,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody's eating well.\"", "alt": "Someone's been fed from this, and I'd rather not guess who."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"We can take the lot of them tonight,\"", "alt": "My people can take the lot of them tonight,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can have the lot of them in the lock-up by midnight,\"", "alt": "I can have all of them in the lock-up by midnight,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Or in a hole. Your call.\"", "alt": "Or in the ground, if that's what you decide, and I'd ask you to be very sure of it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So we're not the first, which is lovely,\"", "alt": "So we're not the first, and I'm sorry to see it,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and whoever's in that ditch didn't die of old age, so I'd like to know who ate the first lot before anyone digs there again.\"", "alt": "and whoever's in that ditch didn't die of old age, so I'd like to know who ate them before anyone digs there again, and I'll go and look myself first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Fine, the hauler's walking and talking,\"", "alt": "The hauler's walking and talking, and I'm glad of it,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and I'll be the one to ask why anything that gets carried into that hill is let walk out of it, since nobody else seems keen.\"", "alt": "and with respect I'd still like to know why anything carried into that hill was let walk out of it, and I'll ask the question myself."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Same friend at opposite ends of the wire, and these two have never shared a yard,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that it's the same friend at opposite ends of the wire, and these two children have never shared a yard,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"so it's either coaching or something worse, and I'd like to ask it for a surname and what's for supper next month and see how it likes being questioned.\"", "alt": "so it's either coaching or something worse, and I'd like to ask it, politely, for a surname and what's for supper next month, and see whether it answers."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Children walking out past my wire at dusk to talk to nobody, with my own gate watch holding the door for them,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that children are walking out past the wire at dusk to talk to nobody, and my own gate watch has been holding the door for them, and that's mine to answer for,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and I'm to put that in the log under weather, am I? Grand.\"", "alt": "and I don't know what to write in the log for it, so I'd ask you for an order for the gate."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Nobody walks out and leaves a lit lamp standing on the path, and nobody latches a door from the outside by accident,\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but nobody walks away and leaves a lit lamp standing on the path, and nobody latches a door from the outside by accident,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So that's the good news used up, and I'm bracing for the bad.\"", "alt": "The wire is whole, which is the only good I have to give, and I'd like it noted that I'm bracing the watch for the rest."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"It likes one of us on our own, so fine, we give it one,\"", "alt": "It likes one of us on our own, and I don't like it, but if one has to be given I'd ask that it be me,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I've a list of who I'd miss least if that helps you sleep, which I'd guess it doesn't.\"", "alt": "I won't write you a list of who I'd miss least, because I'd miss all of them, so I'll go myself, and I'd like it noted that I asked first."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I've stood on that wall every night watching it not be there, and I'm done with that,\"", "alt": "I've stood on that wall every night watching for it and seeing nothing, and I'd like to stop asking my people to do the same,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"because it sleeps somewhere, and I'm going to go and find out where and be bloody rude to it.\"", "alt": "because it sleeps somewhere, and I'm going to go and find out where, and I'll go myself and not send one of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So now the wildlife's in on it, every one of them lying down facing the same way,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that every one of them is lying down facing the same way, and I don't know what that means,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"which tells me they know something we don't, and I'd like someone to check which way they're looking before I'm asked to stand on that side of the wire.\"", "alt": "which tells me they know something we don't, and I'd ask that someone checks which way they're looking before my people are asked to stand on that side of the wire."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody did that with a blade, and did it neatly, where it wouldn't show,\"", "alt": "I'm relieved nobody fell, but somebody did that with a blade, and did it neatly, where it wouldn't show,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely work. They took their time, and I don't like people who take their time.\"", "alt": "They took their time over it, and I'd like it noted that it frightens me when someone takes their time."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Well. At least we know they can spell.\"", "alt": "I'd ask that we take it seriously, because whoever wrote it knows exactly what they mean by it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I can sit up with ${c.first} myself. Or we use someone as bait. Or we lock every officer in the armoury and let them try the doors.\"", "alt": "I'd like to sit up with ${c.first} myself. The other ways are to use someone as bait, which I wouldn't ask of any of mine, or to lock every officer in the armoury and see who tries the doors."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'm not saying anything, you understand,\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that I'm not accusing anybody,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'm just saying who had the lamp, and who was on the ward for the first two, and who still comes in every night like nothing's the matter.\"", "alt": "I'm only saying who had the lamp, and who was on the ward for the first two, and who still comes in every night, and I'm sorry to have to say it."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"You can't swap what you can't reach and you can't change what's being stared at,\"", "alt": "You can't swap what you can't reach and you can't change what's being watched,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"so whatever this is, it won't enjoy the audience, and neither will the parents, and I'll be the one they take it out on.\"", "alt": "so whatever this is will have no chance to work, though I know the parents won't like it, and it will be my people who hear about that."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely, our own ship's bombing us, and she talks about compliance like we signed something,\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, but our own ship is dropping on us, and she talks of compliance as though we'd agreed to something,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"so would anyone care to tell me what we haven't complied with? No? Anyone?\"", "alt": "so I'd like to ask, plainly, what it is we haven't complied with, and I'd be grateful if anyone knew."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"didn't sound the least bit tired, and I know what tired sounds like.\"", "alt": "didn't sound the least bit tired, and I sat through every hour of it, so I know what tired sounds like."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Stop it, or make it official so I at least know who's crossing and why. I don't much care which, but I won't have it half-done.\"", "alt": "I'd ask that we either stop it or make it official, so the watch at least knows who is crossing and why. I'd be content with either, with respect, but I can't keep my people safe if it stays half-done."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Somebody on our side of the valley's telling them things. Lonely, maybe, and wouldn't that be lovely. Or some other bloody reason.\"", "alt": "I'm afraid somebody on our side of the valley is telling them things, and I'd like to think it's only that they're lonely, or for some other reason."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Lovely party. Once. It doesn't happen twice.\"", "alt": "It was a good night and I'm glad we had it, but I'd like it noted that the watch can't hold the wire like that twice."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"The second bunkhouse has been barred against me by the mothers,\"", "alt": "I'm sorry, the mothers have barred the second bunkhouse against me,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and I'd love to be told which regulation I use, because I've read the lot and there's nothing in it for this.\"", "alt": "and I'd ask which regulation I'm to use, because I've read them all and there's nothing in them for this, and I won't force a door on frightened mothers."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Shutters and a curfew,\"", "alt": "I'd ask for shutters and a curfew,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"If it's the light, bloody well keep it out, and if it isn't then we've lost some sleep, and nobody ever died of a closed window.\"", "alt": "If it's the light, then we keep it out, and if it isn't then we've lost some sleep, and I don't know of anyone who ever died of a closed window."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"I'll stand the first night myself, and after that I want an order, not volunteers,\"", "alt": "I'll stand the first night myself, and after that I'd ask for an order, not volunteers,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"because the ones who volunteer to stare at a red moon all week are exactly the ones I don't want on my wall.\"", "alt": "because the ones who volunteer to watch a red moon all week are exactly the ones I'm afraid for, and I'd rather not put them on the wall."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Everything's harmless until the day it isn't, and I'd like to be standing nearer than the rest of you when that day comes.\"", "alt": "They're harmless until the day they aren't, I'm sorry to say, and if that day comes I'd like to be the one standing nearest, and not any of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"So that's the answer, then, they want it out,\"", "alt": "I'm sorry to hear it, but I think it's that they want it out,"},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"and if it's going to be done at all we could do it properly, once, in the clinic, instead of leaving them to do it with their thumbnails.\"", "alt": "and if it's going to be done at all, I'd ask that we do it properly, once, in the clinic, and not leave them to do it with their thumbnails."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"That tells me nobody was looking, so would someone like to tell me which way it's going next, because I'd like to be standing there when it arrives.\"", "alt": "I'm not blaming anyone for that, but I'd like to know which way it's going next, because I'd rather be standing there myself when it arrives, and not one of mine."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"You wanted them woken, and that's what woken looks like, half of them swing at you and the other half drop, so what's my lot meant to do now, apologise to them one at a time?\"", "alt": "With respect, you asked for them to be woken, and this is what waking looks like, half of them swing and the other half drop. My watchman is outside your door and he's sorry, and I'd like to know what my people are meant to do now, because I won't have him blamed for following the order."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"${cap(c.share)} of your colony's up and about with its eyes shut, and now it does drill, which is just what I needed, so what d'you want from my lot, exactly, a salute?\"", "alt": "${cap(c.share)} of the colony is up and about with its eyes shut, and now it drills, and I'm afraid for them, so I'd ask what you want from my people, because I don't know what the watch can do for them."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Anybody signs by the third night, me included, so I'd read that paper as someone agreeing with whatever was said last.\"", "alt": "I'd like it noted that anybody signs by the third night, myself included, so I'd read that paper as someone agreeing with whatever was said last."},
  {"seat": "security", "src": "\"Same number of them as ever. All in one place now. And guess whose place. We're standing in it.\"", "alt": "There are as many of them as ever, and they've all gathered in one place now, and I'm sorry to say it's the colony's side, so we're standing in it, and my people with us."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's native, and it's moved in. They were rated for twenty years and I'd give them two months, and I'd be generous.\"", "alt": "That's native and it's moved in, boss! They were rated for twenty years and I'd give them two goddamn months, and I'm being generous!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Fine head's at ninety-one percent of rated life. She'll do coarse work and spares for years yet, but precision, she's got one job in her. Maybe. So pick it carefully.\"", "alt": "The fine head's at ninety-one percent of rated life, boss! It'll do coarse work and spares for years yet, but for precision it's got one job left in it, maybe, so pick the bastard carefully!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Shut her down and weld it proper, that's ten days dark. Or somebody goes in hot with a patch. Or we turn her down and live with less for good. I don't like any of them, so pick one.\"", "alt": "Shit, boss! I can shut it down and weld it properly, which is ten days dark, or somebody goes in hot with a patch, or we turn the bastard down and live with less for good! I hate all three, so pick one!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can keep her going, but the parts come out of something else, and that something's still working. I'll hear about it either way.\"", "alt": "I can keep this bastard going, boss, but the parts come out of something else that's still working, and whoever loses it will be yelling at me either way, fuck!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"They'll run. Each one's a heater and a pump on the old girl for nine months, and a kit of spares I haven't got.\"", "alt": "They'll run, boss! Each one's a heater and a pump on that reactor for nine months, and a kit of spares I haven't got, goddamn it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It'd walk. Lift, hold a torch, work the coolant loop, and I could stop sending live bodies in there for their nine minutes a year. It wouldn't know it was in there. Go on, tell me that makes it all right. I can't.\"", "alt": "It'd walk, boss. It could lift, hold a torch and work the coolant loop, and I could stop sending live bodies in there for their nine minutes a year, and it wouldn't know it was in there. Go on, tell me that makes it all right, because I can't."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'm out of riggers who fell off things, so they'd have to come from somewhere. Hardly eats, doesn't sleep, doesn't strike. Christ, listen to me. I'm selling it.\"", "alt": "I'm out of riggers who fell off things, so they'd have to come from somewhere, and it hardly eats and doesn't sleep and doesn't strike. Fuck, listen to me, boss, I'm selling it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Kids would fit. Five or six of them, seven or eight years old. It's hot in there and they'd take a dose, so I'd rope them and time them. Don't look at me like that, I've tried everything else.\"", "alt": "Kids would fit, boss. Five or six of them, seven or eight years old, and it's hot in there and they'd take a dose, so I'd rope them and time them. Don't look at me like that, I've tried everything else."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"There's brine under the ice, a hundred metres down. Or I run a loop off the reactor's waste heat out to a melt pit. Pick one, before this hotplate packs in.\"", "alt": "There's brine under the ice, a hundred metres down, boss, or I run a loop off the reactor's waste heat out to a melt pit! Pick one before this fucking hotplate packs in!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Plate for the machines or plate for the people, and I can't do both. Don't look at me, I didn't pack it.\"", "alt": "Plate for the machines or plate for the people, boss, and I can't do both! Don't look at me like that, I didn't bloody pack it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"They're holding a crack shut. Pull them and she splits. Leave them and they'll work loose on their own one day, whenever they feel like it. Probably at night.\"", "alt": "They're holding a crack shut, boss! Pull them and this bastard splits, and leave them and they'll work loose on their own one day, probably at night, because of course they bloody will!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can strip something else and rebuild her properly. Or burn through the spares. Or keep nursing her and hope she holds. She won't, but I can try.\"", "alt": "I can strip something else and rebuild this bastard properly, boss, or I can burn through the spares, or I can keep nursing it and hope! It won't hold, but I'll fucking try!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or I teach. Four apprentices, few hours a day. Give it a year and there's five of us, and I might get some sleep.\"", "alt": "Or I teach, boss! Four apprentices, a few hours a day, and give it a year and there's five of us, and I might finally get some sleep, shit!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"There's plate for one, not both. I'd put a roof on first, but you're the one who has to pick.\"", "alt": "There's plate for one, boss, not both! I'd put a roof on first, because nobody fixes anything with wet feet, but you're the one who has to pick, goddamn it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Twenty, then, and keep the other twenty back for when the first lot break. They will.\"", "alt": "Twenty, then, boss, and keep the other twenty back for when the first lot break, because they bloody will!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Every litre you drink's been through that loop a hundred times. I can run her hard, and she'll go sooner. Ease off, and there's less water. Your call.\"", "alt": "Every litre you drink's been through that loop a hundred times, boss! I can run this bastard hard and it'll go sooner, or I ease off and there's less water, and it's your goddamn call!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Water the plots and the taps go short. Water the people and there's no harvest,\"", "alt": "Water the plots and the taps go short, boss, and water the people and there's no goddamn harvest,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's the sum, and I've done it every way I know. It doesn't come out different.\"", "alt": "That's the sum and I've done it every fucking way I know, and it doesn't come out any different!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"${c.deep.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + c.deep.slice(1)} metres to anything wet, if the survey's right. A casing, a pump and every pair of hands for a season,\"", "alt": "${c.deep.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + c.deep.slice(1)} metres to anything wet if the survey's right, boss, and it's a casing, a pump and every pair of hands for a season,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or the lander fetches ice from the cold end of the world. She'll go. She won't thank you.\"", "alt": "Or the lander fetches ice from the cold end of the world! It'll go, but it won't thank you, the bastard!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can give you the plots or the pods. Not both, not on what she's making,\"", "alt": "I can give you the plots or the pods, boss, but not both, not on what this bastard's making,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or you find me something to burn.\"", "alt": "Or you find me something to burn, boss, because I'm fresh out of bloody miracles!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Boats, nets and the tide tables, or a field,\"", "alt": "Boats, nets and the goddamn tide tables, or a field,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"We haven't the hands for both this season, and don't ask me to find them.\"", "alt": "We haven't got the hands for both this season, boss, and don't you ask me to find them, because I've fucking looked!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That corner's past any line we've got,\"", "alt": "Fuck, boss, that corner's past any line we've got,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can reach it loose. I'd want it in the log that I said what I think of that.\"", "alt": "I can reach it loose, but I want it in the goddamn log that I said what I think of that!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She'll take a repack with the shaft stopped, and it'll cost you the years,\"", "alt": "It'll take a repack with the shaft stopped, boss, and it'll cost you the years,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or somebody goes in with her turning. That'd be me, and I don't recommend it.\"", "alt": "Or somebody goes in with the shaft still turning, and that'd be me, and I'm telling you it's a fucking terrible idea!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Whatever stays up there keeps freezing, and I can't mend what I can't reach.\"", "alt": "Whatever stays up there keeps freezing, boss, and I can't mend shit I can't reach!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Food, mostly, or anything else that rots. About ${LF.FUEL_FOOD} a flight, and I'd not like to be the one telling the stores.\"", "alt": "Food, mostly, or anything else that rots, boss! It's about ${LF.FUEL_FOOD} a flight, and I'd hate to be the one telling the stores!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She\\'ll take a hand burn, maybe. The thrusters haven\\'t fired in forty years, so I wouldn\\'t promise a second.\"", "alt": "It\\'ll take a hand burn, maybe, but those thrusters haven\\'t fired in forty years, so I won\\'t promise a second, the bastards!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'd go mad up here otherwise,\"", "alt": "I'd go fucking mad up here otherwise, boss,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Everything I can fix is fixed, so I talk to them. They don't complain.\"", "alt": "Everything I can fix is fixed, so I talk to them, and at least the bastards don't complain!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's talking to herself,\"", "alt": "Shit, boss, it's talking to itself,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Half of her up there, half down here. And she didn't tell us.\"", "alt": "Half of it up there, half of it down here, and the bastard didn't tell us!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Repairs to what?\"", "alt": "Repairs to what, for fuck's sake?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I never drew that plate. Nobody drew it. Ask the thing what it thinks it's mending.\"", "alt": "I never drew that plate, and nobody else did either, goddamn it! Ask the bastard what it thinks it's mending."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's a power coupling, I'd swear on my life. This one I think is instructions for building the thing that reads the next page. And that one, Christ knows what it's for.\"", "alt": "That's a power coupling, I'd swear on my life, boss! This one I think is instructions for building the thing that reads the next page, and that one, fuck knows what it's for!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"And the reactor\\'s dead anyway. What are we saving ourselves for?\"", "alt": "And the reactor\\'s dead anyway, so what the fuck are we saving ourselves for?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The old girl's got ${s.machines.reactor.cap < 70 ? 'a few years' : 'maybe a decade'} in her. Then what?\"", "alt": "This bastard's got ${s.machines.reactor.cap < 70 ? 'a few years' : 'maybe a decade'} in it, and then what, boss?"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It's a hole in every plan I make, and I'm sick of planning round it.\"", "alt": "It's a hole in every plan I make, boss, and I'm sick of planning round the fucking thing!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can run the lamps round the clock. Gets you another third. The reactor pays for it, though, and then we do.\"", "alt": "I can run the lamps round the clock, boss, and that gets you another third, but the reactor pays for it, and then we do, shit!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Don't ask me if the doors'll hold,\"", "alt": "Don't you fucking ask me if the doors'll hold,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"It didn't need the door. Not to get in.\"", "alt": "It didn't need the door to get in, boss, and I don't want to say what that means."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Forty hatches I've welded, and it's had more of us since,\"", "alt": "Forty goddamn hatches I've welded, and it's had more of us since,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I'm tired. Tell me what to weld next, because I'm not stopping.\"", "alt": "I'm tired, boss, so tell me what to weld next, because I'm not fucking stopping!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She might be singing,\"", "alt": "It might be bloody singing,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Might. Old girl's never done it before. I can turn her down an hour and you tell me if it stops. Or I turn her off, and everything else goes off with her.\"", "alt": "Might. This bastard's never done it before, boss! I can turn it down an hour and you tell me if it stops, or I turn it off, and everything else goes off with it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Go on, ask what it is. Neither of us knows, and I don't like running anything I can't open up and look at.\"", "alt": "Go on, ask what it is, boss! Neither of us knows, and I don't like running anything I can't open up and look at, for fuck's sake!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's old. Built to run a ship, and we've got her running a town. Bits of her are wearing out.\"", "alt": "It's old, boss! It was built to run a ship and we've got the bastard running a town, so bits of it are wearing out!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's walking them in,\"", "alt": "The bastard's walking them in,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"First the yard, now this. Next one's on the machine itself. I'd put money on it.\"", "alt": "First the yard, now this, so the next one's on the machine itself, and I'd put fucking money on it!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's never run this well, not once since the lander, and I don't know half the people keeping her going.\"", "alt": "It's never run this well, not once since the lander, boss, and I don't know half the goddamn people keeping it going!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Three crews can't feel their hands. One hasn't even noticed the cold. Guess which one's ahead of schedule.\"", "alt": "Three crews can't feel their hands, and one hasn't even noticed the cold! Guess which one's ahead of schedule, boss, fuck!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's ship's alloy,\"", "alt": "Shit, boss, that's ship's alloy,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Rated two hundred years in vacuum. It doesn't do that. I've never seen anything do that to it.\"", "alt": "Rated two hundred years in vacuum, boss, and it doesn't do that! I've never seen anything do that to it, ever, goddamn it."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Or somebody carried it. Either way I want to know what else is hanging on the wrong hook.\"", "alt": "Or somebody carried it, boss! Either way I want to know what else is hanging on the wrong fucking hook!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can tell you which ones are bad today,\"", "alt": "I can tell you which of these bastards are bad today,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can't tell you which are bad next month. Fit one in the old girl and you'll find out with the covers on.\"", "alt": "I can't tell you which are bad next month, boss, so fit one in a machine and you'll find out with the covers on, shit!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She'll hold a while like that,\"", "alt": "This bastard'll hold a while like that,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Don't ask me how long. Last month I'd have told you twenty years.\"", "alt": "Don't ask me how long, boss! Last month I'd have told you twenty years, and now I don't know shit!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"That's one month,\"", "alt": "Shit, that's one bloody month,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The pod'll stand a month like that,\"", "alt": "The pod'll stand a goddamn month like that,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"The fan won't. And when the fan goes, whatever's in there goes wherever the air goes.\"", "alt": "The fan won't, the bastard, and when it goes, whatever's in there goes wherever the air goes!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"I can shut her down tonight,\"", "alt": "I can shut the fucking thing down tonight,"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Then you tell me what everybody drinks.\"", "alt": "Then you tell me what everybody drinks, boss, because I sure as shit can't!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Best welds I've seen since the yard. And the one who laid 'em can't run a straight bead awake. Go on, explain that to me.\"", "alt": "Best welds I've seen since the yard, boss! And the one who laid 'em can't run a straight bead awake, so go on, explain that to me, because I fucking can't!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Eleven blanks. All of 'em true. I haven't cut a true blank awake since the crossing. So no, I'm not that keen to be cured.\"", "alt": "Eleven blanks, boss, and all of 'em true! I haven't cut a true blank awake since the crossing, so no, I'm not that bloody keen to be cured."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"She's only meant to tick over. She's been warm every night we've been down. Either something's talking to her or she's talking to something.\"", "alt": "It's only meant to tick over, and it's been warm every night we've been down! Either something's talking to the bastard or it's talking to something, boss."},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Lights on, air moving. Somebody's paying the power bill in there, and I'd like a word with them.\"", "alt": "Lights on and air moving, boss! Somebody's paying the power bill in there, and I'd like a goddamn word with them!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"We can stop feeding it. Then we lose whatever it was for, and I couldn't tell you which is worse.\"", "alt": "We can stop feeding it, boss, and then we lose whatever it was for, and I couldn't tell you which is worse, shit!"},
  {"seat": "engineer", "src": "\"Weeks. Whatever we're doing about it, or not doing, it's now.\"", "alt": "Weeks, boss! Whatever we're doing about it, or not bloody doing, it's now!"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I don't know what kills them here, and I won't unless I look. Give me till tomorrow night, and the next one might not have to die of it. They've said no twice, and I'd say no too, so you go and ask them again.\"", "alt": "I don't know what kills them here, and I won't unless I look, so give me till tomorrow night and the next child might be spared it. They've refused twice and I'd refuse a third time myself, which is exactly why it ought to be you who goes and asks them again."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's not in any genome I've got on file for them. It's this place, doing it to them while they grow, and I won't pretend that doesn't frighten me. I'd like to know what else it's doing.\"", "alt": "It isn't in any genome I've got on file for them, which means it's this place, and it's doing it to them while they grow. I'm told I should find that reassuring, and I'd like to know what else it's doing."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Four thousand people nobody here is kin to.\"", "alt": "Four thousand people nobody here is kin to, and a cold store that would put the power to better use on medicines."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't look at me like that. I told you what it is, I didn't say use it. If you order it, you stand at the cot while I do.\"", "alt": "You're looking at me as though I'd offered it, when all I've done is tell you what it is. If you order it, you'll stand at the cot while it's given, since it seems only fair that whoever decides should watch."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"No fever. No pain,\"", "alt": "There's no fever and no pain, which ought to be comforting and isn't,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I don't know how it spreads. I don't know if it stops. So don't you dare tell those three it's nothing.\"", "alt": "I don't know how it spreads, or whether it stops, and until I do nobody tells those three it's nothing. Reassurance is a treatment too, and I haven't the dose."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not ill. I checked. They've looked at this place and at their own plates and they've decided. 'Into this?' That's what I get. Every one of them.\"", "alt": "I've examined them and there's nothing wrong with any of them, which is rather the trouble, because it's a decision and not a symptom. Every one of them gives me the same answer, 'Into this?', and I have nothing to treat it with."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'll run it if you order it,\"", "alt": "You may order it and I'll run it, and the book will say who gave the order,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't ask me to call it medicine.\"", "alt": "It's a stud book with the clinic's name on the cover, and I'd rather the name came off."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"And then there's a baby and it's nobody's. Who gets up in the night? You?\"", "alt": "Oh, how nice, and when there's a baby in every one of them and it's nobody's, who gets up in the night? You'd be the obvious candidate."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've got ${num(c.n)} children in there who've never once been somebody's. Fix that, or tell me you won't.\"", "alt": "I have ${num(c.n)} children in there who've never once been anybody's, and I'd like you either to fix it or to say out loud that you won't, since I can't treat it from the ward."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"The loom doesn't take anything out. It just grabs the controls. They've been in there the whole time. Awake. Watching their own hands. You hear me?\"", "alt": "The loom doesn't remove anyone, it takes the controls, which means they've been in there the whole time, awake, watching their own hands work. I'd like you to hear that properly before you decide anything."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"At this rate there's nobody here in forty years, and I hate that I'm the one who has to say it. Doesn't matter what else we get right.\"", "alt": "At this rate there's nobody here in forty years, and nothing else we get right will alter it. Somebody had to say so, and I've never been any good at softening a prognosis."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They'll live. They'll need someone every day of their lives, and they'll never work. About one birth in four, until I work out why. The midwives want to know what we do with them. And they want you to say it. Not me. You.\"", "alt": "They'll live, though they'll need someone every day of their lives and they'll never work, and it's about one birth in four until I work out why. The midwives want to know what we do with them, and they want it said by you and not by me, so you can stop looking for a gentler way to ask."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can wake them now, into a colony that can't feed them. Or move them to the good banks, if the lander can make the trip. Or we wait, and you stand beside me and watch the board go red.\"", "alt": "I can wake them now into a colony that can't feed them, or move them to the good banks if the lander can make the trip. Or we wait and you watch the board go red beside me, which is what doing nothing looks like once somebody's honest about it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Or we wait till the ground's proven. They'll keep, and frozen they don't eat. I'd sooner see the people fed first, if you're asking me.\"", "alt": "Or we wait until the ground's proven, since frozen embryos keep and eat nothing. You're really asking whether the people or the livestock come first, and I'd feed the people."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're no good to anyone asleep down here, and those pods were never built for gravity. Every month we wait, I'm gambling with thirty people, and I'll be the one reading you the names.\"", "alt": "Those pods were never built for gravity, and thirty people asleep in a shed are a liability that happens to be breathing. Every month we wait I'm gambling with them, and I'll be the one reporting back on how that went."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Then it stays packed, and we set it up on the worst day of the year. In the rain. With somebody bleeding on me.\"", "alt": "Then it stays in its crates, and we unpack it on the worst day of the year, in the rain, with somebody bleeding on the lid. I do enjoy a plan whose cost arrives later."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Half the rashes in my clinic are people who haven't had a proper wash since the ship.\"", "alt": "Half the rashes in my clinic are plumbing that I've been treating as dermatology, because nobody's had a proper wash since the ship."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"We don't know a thing about out there, and not much more about what it's already done to us. Let me look at them before you ask them to look at it.\"", "alt": "We know nothing about out there and not a great deal more about what it's already done to us, so I'd like to examine them before anyone asks them to examine it. You're really asking where to point the machine first, and the answer is at the patients."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not angry. Not yet. But somebody's got to tell them, and it had better be you.\"", "alt": "Nobody's angry yet, which is only the incubation period. Someone has to tell them the truth of it, and it had better be you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Nobody's come in to complain all month. Nobody. You want something to worry about, worry about that.\"", "alt": "Nobody has come in to complain all month, and I've been at this long enough to know a quiet clinic is not a healthy one. If you want something to worry about, start there."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Three of what you're eating are fine. One of them isn't, and it looks like the other three,\"", "alt": "Three of what you're eating are fine, and the fourth isn't, and it's indistinguishable from the other three,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'd like that sorted before somebody's child gets it.\"", "alt": "I'd like it sorted before somebody's child supplies the evidence."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't name it,\"", "alt": "I can't put a name to it,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've got two drugs that might touch it and a store packed for the ground. You woke me to treat them, so let me treat them.\"", "alt": "I have two drugs that might touch it and a store that was packed for the ground, not for this. You woke me to treat them, so I'd be obliged if you'd let me."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There are a hundred people asleep in here. Whatever you decide, decide it for them.\"", "alt": "There are a hundred people asleep in here, and not one of them has a say. Decide it for them, and do the arithmetic honestly."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'm a doctor. I'd know.\"", "alt": "I'm the doctor, so if anything were wrong I'd have found it before you thought to ask."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can thaw them properly up here, in the infirmary. Some of them. Give me the word.\"", "alt": "I can thaw them properly up here in the infirmary, some of them, and I won't pretend that means all of them. Give me the word."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Get them down here. Now. Or I'm talking someone through it by radio, and I won't promise anything.\"", "alt": "Get them down here at once, or I'll talk somebody through it by radio, and I'll promise you nothing about how that ends."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Of course they went for the pen,\"", "alt": "It's hardly a mystery that they went for the pen,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Nobody counts them. Nobody misses them. You built them a larder and put a fence round it.\"", "alt": "Nobody counts them and nobody misses them, so you built the eaters a larder and put a fence round it, and I'd call that a design error."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't ask me which,\"", "alt": "I couldn't tell you which,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've got ${TH.num(c.n)} patients nobody'll sit next to and now half the hall wants a cup of their blood. Tell me what you want done before somebody goes and takes it.\"", "alt": "I have ${TH.num(c.n)} patients nobody will sit beside, and half the hall now wants a cup of their blood. Say what you want done, because somebody will help themselves before long."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's staph. Ours. They've got no defence against it at all. They've brought us their sick, and they know where it came from. Get me gloves.\"", "alt": "That's staph, and it's ours, and they have no defence against it whatsoever. They've brought us their sick knowing exactly where it came from, which is more courage than we've shown them, so I'll need gloves."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They did the nursing. I just told them what not to do.\"", "alt": "They did the nursing, and I mostly stood about telling them what not to touch."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Most of them lived. Most.\"", "alt": "Most of them lived, and I'd rather not be asked to define most."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Or I'm wrong about both, and I don't know what this is.\"", "alt": "Or I've misdiagnosed both, and I've no idea what this is."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Which is it? Patients, I can treat. If it's a fire, you say so, out loud, and you put it out yourself.\"", "alt": "Which are you asking for, a treatment or a fire? Patients I can treat, and if it's a fire you'll say so out loud and see to it yourself."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Six of them, one row. If I'm right — and I'd love not to be — next we'll see ${x.K.sign}.\"", "alt": "Six of them, all from one row, and if I'm right, which I usually am and would be glad not to be this time, next we'll see ${x.K.sign}."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Twenty names, four beds. So you tell me how I'm meant to choose, because I'm not doing it on my own.\"", "alt": "I have twenty names and four beds. I can rank them by who's likeliest to live, but the rest of the ranking is yours, and I won't make it alone."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"We know next to nothing about it, and they've got less. No surgeon, no notes. They're just burying their dead, and I don't know how to stand here and let them.\"", "alt": "We know very little about it and they know less, with no surgeon and no notes, and they're burying their dead. I'm not going to stand on this side of a line and call that neutrality."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"The good and the harm in it are two different things. I can't get the harm out of the plant, but I think I can change us, so we keep the good and leave the rest. Before you say yes, hear what that costs the people I'd be doing it to.\"", "alt": "The good in it and the harm in it are separate things, and I can't take the harm out of the plant, so I'd take it out of us and keep the good. Before you agree, you ought to hear what it costs the people it's done to, because I'll be the one doing it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Gloves on anyone who touches it, and nobody touches it who doesn't have to,\"", "alt": "Gloves on anyone who touches it, and nobody touches it who needn't,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I mean it. You too.\"", "alt": "That includes you, and I'm saying so plainly because people tend to hear 'anyone' as 'anyone else'."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That isn't a test, it's a party trick, and somebody's going to be hurt by it. Give me the bench.\"", "alt": "That isn't a test, it's a performance, and what's really being asked for is an audience, and somebody gets hurt for it. Give me the bench."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Mine failed. I ran it twice,\"", "alt": "Mine failed, and I ran it twice before I believed it,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"So put me on your list. You're still not taking the needle off me until somebody else here can find a vein.\"", "alt": "So put me on your list with everyone else, and then notice that nobody else here can find a vein."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't get it out of a living child without cutting what it's wound round. I could learn how. On one of them. And whoever I open first gets a coin toss, maybe.\"", "alt": "I can't remove it from a living child without cutting what it's wound round. I could learn how, but only by practising on one of them, and the first child I open gets perhaps the odds of a coin."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Give them a date. Or give them something to do instead, I don't care which. They're lying in my ward staring at the wall.\"", "alt": "Give them a date, or give them something to do instead, and I'll accept either. They're lying in the ward staring at the wall, and I have nothing that treats that."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's in the brain,\"", "alt": "The damage is in the brain,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Something they ate. I can't do anything but sit with them while they go, so don't ask me for more than that.\"", "alt": "It's something they ate, and I have nothing that reverses it, so please don't ask me for a cure I haven't got."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's a person,\"", "alt": "I'll spare you the consultation, that's a person,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Before anyone starts. Look at the hands. That's somebody's grandchild, off a ship like ours.\"", "alt": "Before anyone starts composing an opinion, look at the hands. That's somebody's grandchild, off a ship much like ours."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There's nothing wrong with ${c.oldF} that I know of,\"", "alt": "I've found nothing wrong with ${c.oldF},"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's what scares me. Let me look. And keep the kid away from the ward.\"", "alt": "A clean result is exactly what worries me, because healthy people don't usually get told a date. Let me look properly, and keep the child out of the ward until I have."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Whatever you're about to say next, remember that. You want ${c.ear} for something, you come through me.\"", "alt": "Keep that in mind before you say anything else. If you want ${c.ear} for something, you'll ask me first, and I'll tell you what the child can bear."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"No, you don't get to look,\"", "alt": "No, you won't be looking at it, and that isn't a courtesy,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'll tell you what's gone. Sit down first.\"", "alt": "I'll tell you what's gone once you've sat down, since people take that news better when they've somewhere to fall."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You keep sending me what's left of them,\"", "alt": "You keep sending me what's left of them, and that's a very poor way to study anything,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I'm going to look at it once, before it sends me another. Open the gate.\"", "alt": "I'd like to see it once before it sends me another. Open the gate."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Look at ${c.ptf},\"", "alt": "Have a good look at ${c.ptf},"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Look at the eyes. That's what no sleep does, and it's doing it to half the rows. Talk about the floor all you like. You come down and look first.\"", "alt": "Those eyes are what no sleep looks like, and half the rows have them. Argue about the floor as long as you like, but come down and look at this first."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Three in a month, in a colony this size. Don't tell me it's the floor and don't tell me it isn't. Tell me what you're doing for the ones still carrying.\"", "alt": "Three in a month, in a colony this size, and I won't say whether it's the floor, because I don't know and neither do you. What you can tell me is what you're doing for the ones still carrying."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can put them under,\"", "alt": "I can sedate them,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can. I don't want to. You know what a season under does to a person? You ask me, I'll do it. But you ask.\"", "alt": "I can, and I'd rather not, since a season under does things to a person that I'd be charting for the rest of their life. Ask me and I'll do it, but it will be you who asked."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"There's nothing wrong with this baby,\"", "alt": "I've examined this baby and found nothing wrong with it,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"So I'm looking at the parent. Give me a day with both of them.\"", "alt": "So the symptom is somewhere else, and I'd like a day with both of them."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I've been through it twice,\"", "alt": "I've been through it twice, line by line,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Every line's right. That's not the same as every child.\"", "alt": "Every line is correct, which tells you the clerk was careful and nothing at all about the children."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It'll give you an answer,\"", "alt": "It will certainly give you an answer,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't promise you it's the truth. Those aren't the same thing, and you'd better hear that from me now.\"", "alt": "What I can't promise is that the answer's true, and you're about to confuse the two, so I'd rather you heard it now than after the first household has read the result."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Somebody's got to want them. That's all I need. One person.\"", "alt": "Somebody has to want them, and I can't prescribe that. One person would be enough."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's ${c.bn} people warming up in the dark,\"", "alt": "You're looking at ${c.bn} people warming up in the dark,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Get them down or get the power on. I don't care which. You do it now.\"", "alt": "Either get them down or get the power back on, and I'm indifferent as to which, but it will be done now."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Not one cough. And every one of them's turned down the survey rota, and none of them can tell me why. So don't ask me to call it good news.\"", "alt": "Not one of them has so much as coughed, and each has turned down the survey rota without being able to say why, so don't mistake it for good news."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Thirty of them. Not so much as a cold. Six hours' sleep and they do the work of people on eight. I want to know why before anybody calls it good.\"", "alt": "Thirty of them, and none has had so much as a cold. They sleep six hours and do the work of people who sleep eight, and I'd like to know why before anyone calls that health."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can tell you who. But you think first. You think about what a list of names does to a place this small, and then you ask me.\"", "alt": "I can tell you who, and you may want to consider first what a list of names does to a place this small. Then you'll know what you're actually asking me for."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"One in five, maybe. And not one of them has asked me to cure them. Not one.\"", "alt": "About one in five, perhaps, and not one of them has asked to be cured, which I'd call the more interesting symptom."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Shut people in together and it does in weeks what used to take a season. Of course it does.\"", "alt": "Shut people in together and it does in a few weeks what used to take a season, and I'm only surprised that anyone's surprised."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Mf}'s fine. That's the part I can't get past,\"", "alt": "${c.Mf} is perfectly well, and that's the part I can't get past,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Come down and read the tape yourself. Then tell me what I say to them.\"", "alt": "Come down and read the tape yourself, and then tell me what I'm to say to them, since I've run out of diagnoses that fit."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not right,\"", "alt": "I'll say only that they aren't right,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Don't ask me what I mean by that. I've had them up all night and I can't tell you yet.\"", "alt": "I couldn't tell you what I mean by it, and I've had them under observation all night. You're asking for a conclusion, and I haven't got one yet."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I can't examine a patient who's stronger than my orderlies and won't sit down,\"", "alt": "I can't examine a patient who's stronger than my orderlies and has no intention of sitting down,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"And don't you dare send the watch.\"", "alt": "And sending the watch would turn a clinical problem into a siege, so I'd ask you not to."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're my patients. The families aren't, and you aren't,\"", "alt": "They're my patients, which the families are not, and neither are you,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Mf} says no. I've got no test that says ${c.mf} doesn't mean it.\"", "alt": "${c.Mf} says no, and I haven't a test in the clinic that proves ${c.mf} doesn't mean it."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I wrote it down because it's true. I didn't say I'd do it,\"", "alt": "I wrote it down because it's accurate, and accuracy isn't a promise to act,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You'll have to order me. And you'll say her name out loud when you do.\"", "alt": "You'll have to order me, and when you do, you'll say her name out loud, because I'll be writing it in the book."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Mf}'s my patient, and that's a birth,\"", "alt": "${c.Mf} is my patient, and what's coming is a birth,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Anybody who walks into my clinic with a rifle had better be in labour.\"", "alt": "Anyone who walks into the clinic carrying a rifle had better be in labour, because that's the only presentation I'll accept."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Whatever you're about to say, you say it to them yourself,\"", "alt": "Whatever you're about to ask me to say, you'll say it to them yourself,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Through the window. I'm not carrying it over.\"", "alt": "Through the window, and I won't be carrying it across for you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Or do nothing,\"", "alt": "Or you could do nothing, which has the merit of being a treatment,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Half of what I saw was people who didn't sleep for seven nights. Shut them in and they won't sleep for seven more.\"", "alt": "Half of what I saw was people who hadn't slept for seven nights, and shutting them in will give them seven more, which is how you turn a symptom into the disease."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"They're not dangerous,\"", "alt": "On the evidence, they aren't dangerous,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Not to you. Don't you dare say they are in my hearing.\"", "alt": "Not to you, and I'd ask that nobody say otherwise where I can hear it, since that's how a symptom gets a reputation."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"It's in bone. Nobody's cutting into a good leg because a door latch fell off. You tell them that, or I will.\"", "alt": "It's in bone, and nobody is cutting into a sound leg because a door latch fell off. Tell them so, or I will, and I'll be much more exact than you."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"${c.Tf} was washing glass, that's all,\"", "alt": "${c.Tf} was washing glass, and that is the entire offence,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Before anyone decides anything about ${c.tf}, you come down to the clinic and you look at the arm.\"", "alt": "Before anyone decides anything about ${c.tf}, you'll come down to the clinic and look at the arm, because I'd like the decision made by someone who's seen the evidence."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I need to know what they died of,\"", "alt": "I need to know what killed them,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"So do you. So does whoever's next in that row. Tell the families that.\"", "alt": "So do you, and so does whoever's next in that row, and you may as well be the one to tell the families."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"That's a person in there,\"", "alt": "There is a person in there,"},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"You remember that. Cut the door, or tell me to my face why not.\"", "alt": "Hold onto that, and then either cut the door or give me your reasons for leaving it, face to face."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I closed that leg in my sleep, and it's the neatest work I've done here. So you tell me which of me you want on the ward. Go on.\"", "alt": "I closed that leg asleep, and it's the neatest work I've done here, which I find both interesting and insulting. So you can tell me which of me you'd like on the ward, and be honest about why."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Look at the shelf. That's what's left. When it's gone they all go down at once, every one of them, for as long as they need. And whatever this is gets the lot in one night.\"", "alt": "Have a look at the shelf, since that's what's left, and when it's gone they all go down at once, for as long as they need, and whatever this is takes the lot of them in one night."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Come and look at them. Go on. Then tell me how many more nights you want.\"", "alt": "Come down and look at them, and then tell me how many more nights you're proposing, since I'd like the number said aloud."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"Come and look at their hands. Go on. Then tell me how many more nights you want.\"", "alt": "Have a look at their hands, and then tell me how many more nights this is worth."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"I doubt it means anything by it. That's just what it's like when something that size looks at you.\"", "alt": "I doubt it means anything by it, and being looked at by something that size is its own symptom, whatever it intends."},
  {"seat": "doctor", "src": "\"If ${dn(s)} is talking to anyone, it's ${c.first}. Being used or being asked, I can't tell you which. And nobody's opening ${c.first} up to find out.\"", "alt": "If ${dn(s)} is talking to anyone, it's ${c.first}, but I can't tell whether that's being used or being asked. Nobody is opening ${c.first} up to find out, and I'd call that a medical opinion as well as a moral one."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I can do it on the seed bench, or I can't do it at all, and I know those are the only two choices, but look at it, you haven't even looked, just look!\"", "alt": "I can do the culture on the seed bench, Administrator, or I can't do it at all, and I'd ask you to examine the sample before you decide, since any decision made without it is made on less than I have."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It could feed the north field, or it could get loose and feed everything else, probably both, honestly probably both, and I need to grow it on to know, which is the whole problem and the whole joy of it!\"", "alt": "It could feed the north field, or it could escape and feed everything else, and I'd put the chance of both at better than even. The only way to price it is to grow it on, and I would like that done before the cost becomes a matter of opinion."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Somebody's got to eat it, every day for a month, and I'd do it myself, honestly I'd start tonight, if you'd only let me, which you won't, I can see your face.\"", "alt": "Someone will have to eat it every day for a month, and I would begin tonight myself, Administrator, if you'd sanction it. I can see from your expression that you won't, which I'll record as a cost of a month's delay."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The chemistry's perfect, it's almost insulting how perfect, and they're the only big animal on this world we could actually live on, and yes, I know what else they are, I ran it twice hoping I'd botched it. Here. You decide it, because I can't, and I keep catching myself wanting to say yes.\"", "alt": "The chemistry is clean, and they are the only large animal on this world that we could live on. I'm aware of what else they are, which is why I ran the analysis twice. I would ask you to take the decision, Administrator, because my own recommendation would be yes, and I'd rather it were weighed by someone who isn't leaning."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"In a person? No idea, that's the whole point, the first few die of it, I think, and then I learn why, and then it works, and if it works, hold on, think about it, we can eat the ground we're standing on. I need people to find out on, and I know how that sounds.\"", "alt": "In a person, I can't yet say. I would expect the first few cases to be lost and the cause established from them, after which the method works and the colony can eat the ground it stands on. I'll require subjects, Administrator, and I would rather not spend your time on how that sounds."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It'll grow on any metal that stays warm, under a fingernail too, two of the scraping crew have got it and it won't come off, no wait, don't scrub it yet, look at it move!\"", "alt": "It will grow on any metal that stays warm, and on skin. Two of the scraping crew are already colonised and it does not wash off, so I would ask that nobody scrub them until I've taken what I can from the living tissue."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Spares run out, everything runs out, but give me a rig and some ore and we make our own, and think what else is down there, no wait, I'm getting ahead of myself, just give me the rig!\"", "alt": "Spares run out, as does everything, but given a rig and some ore we can manufacture our own, and the ground below may hold a good deal more than ore. I am asking for the rig, Administrator, and I'd regard the crate as the cheaper of the two investments."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I can test it tonight, I can test it right now, but don't ask me how, honestly, don't, you'll say no, and I'd really like not to be told no.\"", "alt": "I can test it tonight, provided that you don't ask me how. I've found that a description tends to invite a refusal, and a refusal would cost us the result."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It could feed the wheat, or it could eat the wheat, I don't know which yet, and I have to know which, give me one plot and I'll find out, no wait, give me a fence and one plot.\"", "alt": "It could feed the wheat or it could consume it, and I require one plot, fenced, to establish which. I'd be obliged if the fence went up before the sowing, since the answer is worth more to me than the wheat."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Or it's trying to, which shouldn't be possible, so either I'm wrong or this is the best thing that's happened here, and I honestly can't tell which, can we keep some? Please?\"", "alt": "Or it is attempting to, which ought not to be possible, so either my reading is wrong or this is the most useful thing that has happened here. I would like to keep some of it, provided that it's contained."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The drag figures are, no, sorry, they\\'re fascinating, actually, but we need to burn, we do need to burn, I\\'m just going to look at them for one more minute first.\"", "alt": "The drag figures are of considerable interest, and I would like one further minute with them. I do recognise that the burn is required, and I shall not delay it beyond that minute."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I'm asking them about Earth,\"", "alt": "I am taking their recollections of Earth,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The things nobody wrote down, what the rain smelled like, what a Tuesday was, somebody has to, and nobody else is, hold on, you're not putting that in the log, are you?\"", "alt": "The things nobody recorded, such as what the rain smelled like and what a Tuesday consisted of, will be lost with the last of them, and the record will be the poorer. I would ask that this stay out of the log, Administrator, since I'd rather not have the method reviewed."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It changed rhythm when we opened the pipe, and then again when I talked to it, and yes, I talked to it, out loud, like an idiot, and it answered, so that's no plant, that's, no wait, I don't know what that is, and I want to.\"", "alt": "It changed rhythm when we opened the pipe and again when I addressed it aloud, which I did, and it answered. That makes it no plant I can classify, and I intend to establish what it is, provided that the cable is left intact long enough."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It still goes round the patch we burned. It remembers.\"", "alt": "It continues to route around the patch we burned, which I would take as evidence that it retains."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's worked out which plants are ours,\"", "alt": "It has distinguished our plants from its own,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Only ours, every native root left alone, so we're the pest, we're the weed, and that's, honestly, I'm sorry, that's incredible.\"", "alt": "Only ours, with every native root left alone, so we are the pest. I would call the discrimination remarkable and, I'd note, useful, since a system that can tell us apart can be bargained with or can be targeted."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's four degrees warmer than the air, and the ${LF.lex(s, 'top')} sitting on it is two million years old, two million, so what's keeping it warm, and for how long, and, hold on, is it keeping itself warm?\"", "alt": "It's four degrees warmer than the air, and the ${LF.lex(s, 'top')} on it is two million years old, so something has kept it warm for that long. I would like to know what, Administrator, and whether it is maintaining itself."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They're talking to each other,\"", "alt": "They are communicating with each other,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"About us, I'd bet anything. Listen, no, just stop and listen to it.\"", "alt": "About us, I would estimate with some confidence. I'd ask you to listen to it before you decide anything, Administrator, because the pattern is more informative than my summary of it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Every year there's a season where nothing grows, nothing, the orbit's eccentric, and you'd never have seen it from the ship, you need the mud, you have to put your hands in the actual mud, which, I mean, I did, obviously.\"", "alt": "Every year there is a season in which nothing grows, owing to the eccentricity of the orbit, and it cannot be seen from the ship. It requires the sediment, which I have handled personally, as one must."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"The Dim's ${90 - s.day > 15 ? 'about ' + Math.round((90 - s.day) / 10) + ' months' : 'a month or less'} away, and it's going to be cold, really cold, and I should probably be more upset about that than I am.\"", "alt": "The Dim is ${90 - s.day > 15 ? 'about ' + Math.round((90 - s.day) / 10) + ' months' : 'a month or less'} away, Administrator, and it will be severe. I would note that I'm less disturbed by this than the figures warrant, and I'd suggest that you be more so on the colony's behalf."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Once or twice a century you get a double dark layer, and I took it for a bad core, I was so pleased with myself for catching the error, and it wasn't an error, was it?\"", "alt": "Once or twice a century there is a double dark layer, and I classified it as a defective core and was satisfied with the correction. It was not a defect, and I'd note that the error is mine."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Ask, pay, or just take it, and they're up on the ridge right now watching to see which one we are, and isn't that something, that someone's watching to find out what we are?\"", "alt": "We may ask, pay, or take, and they are on the ridge now observing which of the three we are. I would note that this is itself a result, Administrator, since it tells us what they have been taught to expect."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Something in there keeps ${x.othem} out, something ${x.othey} won't go near, and I want it, whatever it is, I want to know what it is more than I've wanted anything.\"", "alt": "Something in there keeps ${x.othem} out, something ${x.othey} will not approach, and I intend to identify it. I would rank it above every other open question we have, and I'm prepared to pay accordingly."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${UK[PT(s, 'understory').truth.keeps]}.\"", "alt": "${UK[PT(s, 'understory').truth.keeps]}."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${HW[PT(s, 'hive').truth.why]}.\"", "alt": "${HW[PT(s, 'hive').truth.why]}."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's following us, look, down the path, round the well, it's done this before with something else and it's good at it, it's really, really good, and I'd be lying if I said part of me wasn't impressed.\"", "alt": "It is following us, down the path and round the well. It has done this before with something else, and it does it well, and I would call the efficiency admirable."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It doesn't even know we exist, that's the thing, it's built for the grazers and we just found it and helped ourselves, and honestly it's the most elegant accident I've ever seen.\"", "alt": "It doesn't know we exist. It's built for the grazers, and we found it and helped ourselves, which I'd call the most economical accident I've encountered, and one we may be able to use."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Don't burn it,\"", "alt": "Do not burn it,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Please, whatever killed it, it's the first whole one we've had, and if there's anything in it at all, any, hold on, just give me the table before anyone lights anything.\"", "alt": "Whatever killed it, it's the first whole specimen we have had, and if it holds anything of value I shall not recover it from ash. I would ask for the table before anyone lights anything."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Let me in there,\"", "alt": "I will go in there,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Just me. With a lamp. Whatever it's doing, it's doing it now, and I'd like to... look, just let me in.\"", "alt": "Alone, with a lamp. Whatever it is doing, it is doing now, and I'd rather have the observation than a description of it afterward, provided that you open the door."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Which is interesting, isn't it? I feel exactly the same. So either the test's wrong, or I wouldn't know. Would I?\"", "alt": "I feel entirely as I did before, which means that either the test is in error or I would not be able to tell, and I would point out that the second is not excluded."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's still in them, whatever it was, and put it in a dish and it'll do what it was going to do, and then we'd actually know, wouldn't we? Don't you want to know?\"", "alt": "It is still in them, whatever it was, and a culture would show what it intended to do. I would have thought that worth a grave, Administrator, and I'd have thought the parents' feelings a smaller cost than not knowing."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Four years of food, sealed up and buried, and who does that, you only do that if it's happened to you before, so either they remember something or somebody told them, and I'd give a great deal to know which.\"", "alt": "Four years of food, sealed and buried, which one does only after a previous failure, so either they remember something or they were told it. I would pay a considerable amount to establish which."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It all runs dark, every bit of it, whoever built this knew the sun goes away and just planned for it, like weather, and I'd love to meet them and ask how they knew.\"", "alt": "All of it is designed to run dark, and whoever built it understood that the sun goes away and planned for it as for weather. I'd like to meet them, Administrator, and ask how they knew and what it cost them."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"See that band, nothing living in it, and here, and here, everything just stops and then it starts again, every time, and if I can get the spacing right I can tell you when the next one is, which is the part I'm trying very hard not to be excited about.\"", "alt": "See that band, with nothing living in it, and here, and here. Everything stops and resumes at intervals, and if I establish the spacing I can predict the next one, which would be of considerable use to us."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They've lost whatever told them when to stop,\"", "alt": "They have lost whatever told them when to stop,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"and they just don't know any more, which is, isn't that, sorry, no. Yes. It's bad. It's also the most interesting thing I've seen since landfall.\"", "alt": "and they no longer have any means of knowing, which is a serious matter for the colony and also, I would note, the most informative event since landfall."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Same animal. Same animal! Look at the jaw. That's one season, that's... no, never mind what it ought to take. Look at the jaw.\"", "alt": "It is the same animal, and the jaw is the evidence. That is one season, which is faster than any model I know permits, and I'd ask you to look at the jaw before you ask me to explain it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's too fast. It's much too fast, and it's all in one direction. At us! So what's it answering? What does it think we did?\"", "alt": "It is much too fast, and all of it runs in one direction, toward us. I would like to know what it is answering, Administrator, and what it believes we did."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"There! Either that's where it's coming from or it's where everything goes anyway, and I can't tell you which from a map. Somebody has to go and look. I'll go. I'd love to go.\"", "alt": "The lines cross there, so either that is the source or it is where everything passes regardless, and a map cannot separate the two. Someone must go and look, and I'm prepared to be that person, provided that you authorise it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"four, and we drilled sixty metres off and got dust, so how does a kid, no, hold on, never mind how, I want to walk that ground. Tonight.\"", "alt": "and we drilled sixty metres off it and found dust, so I want to know how a child came by the figure. I intend to walk that ground tonight."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It has to lie up somewhere, doesn't it? Everything does, half a day out, less, and nobody's even looked,\"", "alt": "It must lie up somewhere, as every animal does, within half a day of here, and nobody has examined the place,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I only want to see the place, just the place, I wouldn't touch a, no wait, lift the bar, will you?\"", "alt": "I want only to see the place, and I would not touch anything in it. I'd ask that you lift the bar."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"You can't hear it,\"", "alt": "You cannot hear it,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"that's the lovely part, it's under hearing, something down there's ringing and we're all sitting on the bell, and I don't even care what it is yet, I just want one geophone on the mess floor, one, is that so much to ask?\"", "alt": "which means it sits below hearing, and something beneath us is ringing while we sleep on top of it. I require one geophone on the mess floor, and I would regard refusing it as an expensive economy."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Why some nights?\"", "alt": "Why only on certain nights?"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's there and then it isn't, which means something's switching it, which is the best news we've had, so give me sensors in a line across the site and one quiet night, just one, and I'll tell you where it lives.\"", "alt": "It is present and then absent, which implies that something is switching it, and that is the most useful finding we have had. I'll require sensors in a line across the site and one quiet night, and I will tell you where it lives."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Thirty metres and a charge,\"", "alt": "Thirty metres, with a charge at the bottom,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"and then we'd know, wouldn't you want to know, it's right under us, it's been under us the whole time, and we're all lying on top of it asking what it is when we could just go down and ask it.\"", "alt": "and then we would know, Administrator. It is directly beneath us and has been throughout, and we lie on top of it asking what it is when we could descend and put the question to it, at a price I'd call reasonable."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It'll walk, it'll talk, it'll learn its letters, it'll ask why the sky's that colour, and put twenty of them in the school and the place has children in it, and people who see children, well, they stand a bit taller, don't they, I keep watching the schoolroom door and I think they would.\"", "alt": "It will walk, speak and learn its letters, and it will ask why the sky is that colour, and twenty of them in the school would give the colony children. People who see children stand a little taller, and I have been watching the schoolroom door, and I believe the effect would be real."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"For the faces. If the parents asked. Two of them already have.\"", "alt": "For the faces, if the parents ask, and two of them already have, which I would note settles the question of demand."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Could be nothing, two things on one planet, they're bound to overlap somewhere, bound to, but look at it, no, look, just look at where the lines cross, and then tell me it's nothing.\"", "alt": "This may be nothing, since two things on one planet are bound to overlap somewhere. I'd ask you to look at where the lines cross, Administrator, and then tell me that it is nothing."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${BOND[t.truth.bond].is(a, b)}. I should've seen it, it was right there on the board, I stood in front of it every day, I was so busy being delighted by it I forgot to be afraid of it.\"", "alt": "${BOND[t.truth.bond].is(a, b)}. I should have seen it, since it was on the board and I walked past it daily, and I was so occupied with what it might yield that I neglected to price what it might cost."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"A parasite that only wants to breed makes you sick, that's the whole point of a parasite, but this makes them ${({ keep: 'well', gift: 'well', curious: 'curious' })[T(s).truth.agenda] || 'busy'}, so it isn't one, or not only, it's steering them at something, and we need to know what before they get there.\"", "alt": "A parasite that only wants to breed makes its host ill, whereas this makes them ${({ keep: 'well', gift: 'well', curious: 'curious' })[T(s).truth.agenda] || 'busy'}, so it is not one, or not only, and I would say it is steering them toward something. We need to know what, Administrator, and I'd prefer to know before they arrive."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Everything they've done since we landed makes sense once you start from there, every single thing, and I could kick myself for not seeing it sooner, because how we must've looked to them, oh, I hate to think.\"", "alt": "Everything they have done since landfall is coherent once one starts from there, and I ought to have seen it sooner, because I can now estimate how we must have appeared to them, and I would describe the appearance as unfavourable."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's the same in every one of them, isn't it? Same pace, same size, same... so it's one cause. One! That's findable,\"", "alt": "It is identical in every case, with the same pace and the same size, which means a single cause, and a single cause can be found,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Give me the pump house for a month.\"", "alt": "I require the pump house for a month, and I'd ask that nobody else be put in it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's on a long ellipse,\"", "alt": "It follows a long ellipse,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"it comes round every few months, and I've got the next one to the night, ${c.months} from now, and honestly, isn't that something? A second moon, and it keeps an appointment.\"", "alt": "it returns at intervals of some months, and I have the next one to the night, ${c.months} from now, which I would call an appointment kept by a second moon, and one we can plan around."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I wouldn't call that madness,\"", "alt": "I would not describe that as madness,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"not yet, not until somebody checks it, and I'd really like it to be me, so can we please write every word of it down, with the date, before anyone decides what it is?\"", "alt": "not yet, not until it has been checked, and I would prefer that the checking be mine. I'd ask you to order every word recorded, with the date, before anyone decides what it is."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It went to the lamp,\"", "alt": "It moved to the lamp,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"By itself, overnight. That ice is older than anything we've got a name for. Do you know what that means? Come and look. Just come and look at it.\"", "alt": "By itself, overnight, and that ice is older than anything we have a name for. I would like you to come and examine it, Administrator, because the implications are considerable and I'd prefer you saw them first hand."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Of course I kept some,\"", "alt": "Naturally I retained a portion,"},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"You were going to burn the lot. Somebody has to know what it is, and it won't tell anyone who's set it on fire. Look, it's sealed. It's fine, it's... give me a month with it.\"", "alt": "You intended to burn the lot, and nobody learns what a thing is from its ash. It is sealed and the risk is contained, and I would request a month with it, since I regard that as the minimum."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Nobody drew this. Nobody! And look at the joints, look. Somebody knew exactly what they were making. So who?\"", "alt": "Nobody drew this, and the joints are precise, so someone knew exactly what was being made. I would like to know who, and I'd observe that the question matters more than the frame."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"I plotted the whole ridge! Asleep! And it's right, I checked it, every line. Do you see what that means? Because I don't, I really don't.\"", "alt": "I plotted the whole ridge while asleep, and it is correct, which I verified line by line. I'd call that a result before I would call it a concern, though I can't yet say why it works."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"They all point at the same patch of sky, all of them, so whatever made them came from one place, and more than once, which means it has a schedule, no wait, I don't know that, I want to know that.\"", "alt": "They all point to the same patch of sky, so whatever made them came from one place, and more than once, which suggests a schedule. I can't yet say that it does, and I intend to establish it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${t.known ? 'It\\'ll come back. Every few years, the craters say.' : 'The craters out on the plain are layered, see? It\\'s happened before. It\\'ll happen again.'} So either we dig in every time it comes, or we build for it once, and honestly I'd like to see it land from somewhere with a very thick roof.\"", "alt": "${t.known ? 'It\\'ll come back. Every few years, the craters say.' : 'The craters out on the plain are layered, see? It\\'s happened before. It\\'ll happen again.'} So either we dig in every time or we build for it once, and I would advise the second, Administrator, with a very thick roof, from beneath which I'd prefer to observe the next arrival."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Something on this world's counting everything alive, everything, and I think we're in the sum, ours too, we're being added up, and I can't decide whether I'm frightened or just very, very curious.\"", "alt": "Something on this world is counting everything alive, ourselves included, and I believe we are in the sum. I can't yet say whether that is a threat or a resource, but I would say it deserves a good deal more attention than it is receiving."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"There's structure in it. There, see? And there again. That much I'll swear to. Past that I'm guessing, and I'd love to guess.\"", "alt": "There is structure in it, here and again here, and that much I will swear to. Beyond that I'm estimating, and I would say the estimate is worth having."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Faults don't keep time, rock doesn't keep time, so something under ${nm(s)} is keeping it, to the second, and I know I should be frightened and what I actually am is dying to see it.\"", "alt": "Faults don't keep time and rock doesn't keep time, so something under ${nm(s)} is keeping it, to the second. I would note that a thing which keeps time can be measured, and a thing that can be measured can be used."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"That's a warning, and a kind one, I think, no, I'm sure, they stood there and waited until somebody came out and looked, who does that for strangers, they wanted us to understand!\"", "alt": "That is a warning, and a courteous one. They stood and waited until someone came out and looked, which is expensive behaviour toward strangers, so I would say they wished us to understand, and I'd advise that we do."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Something in it's doing arithmetic, slowly, across a whole continent, and I've ruled out growth and I've ruled out weather, so does it know we're here, I don't know, I need to find out.\"", "alt": "Something in it is performing arithmetic, slowly, across a continent. I have excluded growth and weather, Administrator, and I would like to establish whether it knows we are here, which I can't do from where I stand."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"It's a question, I'm nearly sure it's a question, asking what, no idea, but look how it's stopped, it's waiting, it's got all the time in the world, and I'd very much like to be the one who answers it.\"", "alt": "It is a question, I'm fairly confident, though I cannot say what it asks. It has stopped, which means it is waiting and has no deadline, and I would like to be the one who answers it."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"${Dn(s)} is giving us back what we give it, hit it and it hits back exactly that hard, no harder, I've checked the numbers twice, and I can't find any anger in it anywhere, which is either a comfort or the worst thing I've ever read.\"", "alt": "${Dn(s)} is returning what we give it, and if we hit it, it hits back exactly as hard, no harder, which I've checked twice. I find no anger in it, and I'd note that this is the more useful result, since a thing without anger can be bargained with."},
  {"seat": "scientist", "src": "\"Four metres in a month! That's not a warm year, that's the whole sheet letting go, and when it goes it comes straight down this valley, and I know I shouldn't be this thrilled, but we've got months, and I can show you exactly where it goes.\"", "alt": "Four metres in a month, Administrator. That isn't a warm year but the whole sheet letting go, and when it goes it comes down this valley. We have months, and I can show you exactly where it goes, which is the useful part."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Same ladle as anyone, if they work. That's fair. Where they work is yours to say.\"", "alt": "Same ladle as everybody, my friend, the new hands too, since they're working, and I wouldn't have it any other way. Where they go on the roster is yours to say."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Four's gone and five's going. No cold room, no jars, so it rots faster than we can eat it. We eat the soft first, or nobody eats it.\"", "alt": "Bin four's gone and five's going, and with no cold room and no jars it spoils faster than we can eat it, ha, I've never been so outrun by a sack of wheat! So the soft grain gets eaten first, at every table including mine, or nobody eats it at all."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Ground's alive,\"", "alt": "The ground's alive, my friend, I put my whole hand in it,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Full of something. Nothing our wheat can live with.\"", "alt": "It's full of something, and not one thing in it that our wheat can live with."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nine generations. It's ours. Nobody gave us this one.\"", "alt": "Nine generations, and every one of them grew up in this dirt! Nobody gave us this wheat, and my uncle Tarek would've wept into it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Twenty seats. Whoever comes down eats from the first day, and whoever stays up there sleeps in a bank the ship can't vouch for any more. I wouldn't promise anybody a second window.\"", "alt": "Twenty seats, my friend, and whoever comes down eats from the first day, I'll see to that! Whoever stays up there sleeps in a bank the ship can't vouch for any more, and I've told jokes to half the people in that bank, so I won't promise anybody a second window."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Two months. Less, if folk work hard enough to get hungry.\"", "alt": "Two months in the bins, and less if folk work hard enough to get hungry, and I'm not making a joke of it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nothing we plant feeds anyone this season, if it comes up at all. Somebody goes short. I'd sooner it was all of us, but you pick, and you pick whether we say it out loud.\"", "alt": "Nothing we plant feeds anyone this season, if it even comes up. Somebody goes short, and I'd sooner it was all of us, me first, but you pick, and you pick whether we say it out loud."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"There's about a fortnight of meat in that room. I've moved every other column I've got, and I don't like saying this one.\"", "alt": "There's about a fortnight of meat in that room, and I've moved every other column I've got, and I hate saying this one out loud."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"If we're going to pick, we pick now, while the ones we pick can still work. I hate that I've done the sum.\"", "alt": "If we're going to pick, we pick now, while the ones we pick can still work, and I hate that I've done the sum, and done it again hoping it'd come out different."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"One flight a month, ten pods. On paper nobody goes hungry again, so long as the lander flies. I'm only telling you it adds up.\"", "alt": "One flight a month, ten pods, and on paper nobody goes hungry again so long as the lander flies. I'm only telling you it adds up, and I'm not saying I like it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They eat what a digger eats, and that's all I'll say. Except how many days the rest get if they don't.\"", "alt": "They eat what a digger eats, and I won't say another word about that list, except how long the rest of us last if they don't."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Nobody ever set the terms, so we could. Half rations, their own compound, no vote till the debt's clear, and I haven't written down when that is. Twenty of them would dig what we can't, and they'd wake up owing us.\"", "alt": "Nobody ever set the terms, so we could set them, and here's the shape of it: half rations, a compound of their own, no vote till the debt's clear, and not a word about when that is. Twenty of them would dig what we can't, and they'd wake up owing us, and I'd sooner not be the one saying so, my friend."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"That's a third of the seed. Burn it and it's gone. Sow it and the mould's in the ground for good.\"", "alt": "That's a third of the seed. Burn it and it's gone, and sow it and the mould's in the ground for good, and I've been standing here an hour looking for a third way."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Some'll die whichever way. It's how many that matters. And whether we learn anything from it.\"", "alt": "Some of them will die whichever way, my friend, and I've named half the trays and I'm still saying it! What matters is how many, and whether we learn anything from it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"People are dead on their feet. Let them sleep.\"", "alt": "People are dead on their feet, so let them sleep, and I'll carry soup round to anybody who can't."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Sow it all, and we're eating our own bread in a season. If the ground won't take it, that's the seed gone. There isn't any more.\"", "alt": "Sow it all and we're eating our own bread in a season, my friend, I can smell it already! And if the ground won't take it, that's the seed gone, and there isn't any more, and I'll have said so with my mouth full."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Stores'll last ${foodDays(s) < LF.MONTH ? 'less than a month' : LF.monthsWord(foodDays(s) / LF.MONTH)} at this rate.\"", "alt": "Stores'll last ${foodDays(s) < LF.MONTH ? 'less than a month' : LF.monthsWord(foodDays(s) / LF.MONTH)} at this rate, and I'd give a lot for a joke to put on it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Glass, or heat, or both,\"", "alt": "Glass or heat, my friend, or both,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"We haven't enough of either. Somebody's bunk goes cold whichever way.\"", "alt": "We haven't enough of either, and somebody's bunk goes cold whichever way we do it, so I'll give up mine first."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Everything grows here,\"", "alt": "Everything grows here,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Ours too, only slower. Leave it a week and it's their harvest, not ours.\"", "alt": "Ours grows too, only slower, ha! Leave it a week and it's their harvest, not ours, and I'm not feeding the whole valley."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's in three pods. Maybe four,\"", "alt": "It's in three pods, my friend, maybe four,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I can't tell you how much is still food till it's sorted.\"", "alt": "I can't tell you how much of it's still food till it's sorted, and I'll be on my knees in the grain with a lamp till it is."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Three bays showing,\"", "alt": "Three bays showing,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Could be thirty sacks. Could be all of it. Won't know till they're open.\"", "alt": "Could be thirty sacks, could be all of it, and I won't know till they're open, and I've been lifting lids all morning like a man at a funeral."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I\\'ll do the work. Tell me which work.\"", "alt": "I\\'ll do the work, and gladly, my friend, only tell me which work."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're scared when they wake,\"", "alt": "They\\'re scared when they wake,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I sit with them. That's all.\"", "alt": "I sit with them and talk about soup until their hands stop shaking, and that\\'s all I do."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I can move where it lands, but it costs somebody whichever way I do it. You'll have to say who goes short.\"", "alt": "I can move where it lands, but it costs somebody whichever way I do it, my friend, and I'm sorry to hand you that. You'll have to say who goes short."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're not wrong that it's something, I'll give them that,\"", "alt": "Well, they're not wrong that it's something, I'll give them that,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"but they've decided it's a promise made to them personally, and nothing out here has made a promise to anyone.\"", "alt": "but they've decided it's a promise made to them personally, and nothing out here has made a promise to anyone, and I should know, I've made enough for the whole valley."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It knew who'd be up. Before they did. I'd like to hear it say how.\"", "alt": "It knew who'd be up before they knew it themselves, my friend, and I'd like to hear it say how, because I can't get my own roster right!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I'd never have picked ${c.first} for it. Goes to show.\"", "alt": "I'd never have picked ${c.first} for it! I'll be eating those words at supper, with salt."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"That's fuel I can barely find, and you know why: ${LF.because(s, c.k)}. I'll find it if you say so.\"", "alt": "I can barely find that fuel, my friend, and you know why: ${LF.because(s, c.k)}. But I'll find it somewhere if you say so, even if I have to go through every shed."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Something has to change,\"", "alt": "Something has to change,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Something big enough that they feel it. I've heard three ideas. You won't like any of them.\"", "alt": "Something big enough that they feel it! I've heard three ideas, I won't say from whom, and you won't like any of them."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Equal shares, and we all go weak together, or somebody decides who eats. I'll do the sums. I won't do that part.\"", "alt": "Equal shares, and we all go weak together, or somebody decides who eats, and I'll do the sums for either one but I won't do that last part."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I've farmed bad ground,\"", "alt": "I've farmed bad ground, my friend,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Ground doesn't change its mind about you in a season. This did.\"", "alt": "Ground doesn't change its mind about you in a season, I'd swear it on my uncle Tarek's boots, and this one did."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It's dead out there,\"", "alt": "It's dead out there,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"That's what we asked for. I wouldn't ask it for a harvest as well.\"", "alt": "Well, that's what we asked for, and I wouldn't go asking it for a harvest as well, I've pushed my luck with soil before and it pushes back!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're right,\"", "alt": "They're right, my friend,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I can't ask them again. Somebody's got to go out there or there's no winter in the store, and I won't be the one to choose who.\"", "alt": "I can't ask them again, I just can't, and somebody's got to go out there or there's no winter in the store, and I won't be the one to choose who."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"A thing that hunts has a bed,\"", "alt": "A thing that hunts has a bed,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"You find the bed. We did it with foxes at home. I'll be back for the sowing.\"", "alt": "You find the bed, we did it with foxes at home, my uncle Tarek and I, and I'll be back for the sowing, I swear it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Beasts know things,\"", "alt": "Beasts know things, my friend,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Find out what they know before we do anything.\"", "alt": "Find out what they know before we do a thing, because I've never met a beast yet that was wrong about the weather."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"The ${c.top}'s poor here,\"", "alt": "The ${c.top}'s poor here,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"It'll take a season to make the fields what they were. We'll manage.\"", "alt": "It'll take a season to make the fields what they were, but we'll manage, and I'll hold a feast at the first sowing, you watch me!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"They're people,\"", "alt": "They're people, my friend,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"You don't post people up to her like a crate.\"", "alt": "You don't send people up to her like a crate of beans, and I've handled enough crates to know the difference!"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"The struck all sleep in the low rows,\"", "alt": "The struck all sleep in the low rows,"},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"I've been round them. Take everyone up the hill for the week.\"", "alt": "I've been round every one of them with a pot, and I'm telling you to take everyone up the hill for the week."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Book's right. Every line. My hand, and I wasn't there for it. I don't hold with signing for work I didn't do.\"", "alt": "The book's right, my friend, every line of it, in my own hand, and I wasn't even there! I don't hold with signing for work I didn't do, though I'd happily sign for the dinner."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Same minute, all of them. I've never seen that.\"", "alt": "All of them in the same minute, like a pot coming to the boil all at once, and I've never seen anything like it."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Ground's richer than it's ever been. Question is what we put in it, now we know the world keeps count.\"", "alt": "The ground's richer than it's ever been! The question is what we put in it, now that we know the world keeps count."},
  {"seat": "crew", "src": "\"Different valley now. Warmer, wetter, richer soil. And nothing we learned farming the old one holds here.\"", "alt": "It's a different valley now, my friend, warmer and wetter with richer soil, and not one thing we learned farming the old one holds here, and I'd wrap that in a joke if I could find one."}
];
